# Nucleon-seed pools. Nucleon rows are generated deterministically from
# (master_seed, pool address) by default -- see EMULATOR_SWEEP_PLAN.md decision
# D2 -- so no pool is needed. A pool is only required by the legacy
# seed_source: "file" path; generate one reproducibly with
#   python3 utilities/make_seed_pool.py --output shared_seeds/nucleon-seeds.hdf \
#       --number-configs N --number-nucleons A --seed 8675309
shared_seeds/
nucleon-seeds*.hdf
